{"repositoryId":1210534143,"availability":"available","full":"avikalpg/byok-relay","name":"byok-relay","description":"Bring your own key (BYOK) relay to enable lightweight frontend-only apps to use LLMs using the user's API keys without hitting CORS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":55,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-14T14:06:56Z","updated":"2026-09-20T08:04:45Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://byokrelay.com","topics":["ai","ai-gateway","anthropic","api-proxy","bring-your-own-key","browser-safe","byok","cors","gemini","llm","llm-gateway","llmops","no-backend","nodejs","openai","relay","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://codespaces.new/avikalpg/byok-relay?quickstart=1","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:42.533Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:42.533Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:42.533Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.743Z","stars":55,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T05:04:42.533Z","stars":55,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Website: byokrelay.com | Hosted relay: relay.byokrelay.com","Your users bring their own AI keys. byok-relay lets them use those keys straight from the browser — CORS handled, keys never in your code, costs on their bill.","Browser apps can't call api.openai.com or api.anthropic.com directly — CORS blocks them. The usual fix (a backend proxy) puts your users' keys — and your users' AI costs — on your tab. byok-relay flips this: each user gets a secure token; they store their own key; they pay for their own inference. You build the product."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b9a17f1854312f5e9fc314be0d0b884d7900cfb4b889bc5eb017cb801600ff86","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.838Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.838Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Website: byokrelay.com | Hosted relay: relay.byokrelay.com","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Option B — Self-host in 3 commands:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"For production: self-host.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"In the individual flow, users register once; every request uses their provider API key and is billed to their existing provider API account — no gateway balance required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"In the individual flow, users register once; every request uses their provider API key and is billed to their existing provider API account — no gateway balance required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"¹ OpenRouter offers two BYOK mechanisms: workspace provider keys (org-scoped, configured by the operator) and end-user OAuth/PKCE (users authenticate with their OpenRouter account, not their provider account directly). byok-relay takes a different approach: users register their own provider API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, etc.) directly inside your product — no OpenRouter…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"¹ OpenRouter offers two BYOK mechanisms: workspace provider keys (org-scoped, configured by the operator) and end-user OAuth/PKCE (users authenticate with their OpenRouter account, not their provider account directly). byok-relay takes a different approach: users register their own provider API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, etc.) directly inside your product — no OpenRouter…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b9a17f1854312f5e9fc314be0d0b884d7900cfb4b889bc5eb017cb801600ff86","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.840Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-20T08:04:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.845Z","hash":"b9a17f1854312f5e9fc314be0d0b884d7900cfb4b889bc5eb017cb801600ff86","originalBytes":111628,"storedBytes":111628,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.851Z","subjects":["Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Self-hosted apps"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Self-hosted apps","source":"metadata","match":"self hosted"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Streaming","MCP servers & agents","Image, audio & video AI","Templates & UI components","Privacy & security"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://codespaces.new/avikalpg/byok-relay?quickstart=1","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","target":"https://github.com/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fcodespaces%2Fnew%2Favikalpg%2Fbyok-relay%3Fquickstart%3D1","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T03:01:36.518Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://codespaces.new/avikalpg/byok-relay?quickstart=1","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T03:01:36.518Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/78c730a6cc645408ba318840.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T03:01:36.518Z","url":"https://codespaces.new/avikalpg/byok-relay?quickstart=1"}],"